  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 27/05/2025, the proposal  as shown on the drawings submitted on 28/05/2025and numbered 'DEW/2025/02/156S/S2, DEW/2025/02/156S/01, DEW/2025/02/156S/02, DEW/2025/02/156S/03, DEW/2025/02/156S/04, DEW/2025/02/156S/05 (2 sheets indicating proposed floor plans and elevations)'  was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.\r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 1, Class B B.1(f) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because: \r\n\r\nThe application site is within a designated Conservation Area, defined as Article 2(3) land under Schedule 1, Part 1(a) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) and the enlargement of a dwellinghouse consisting of an addition or alteration to its roof is not 'permitted development' where the dwellinghouse is on article 2(3) land. \r\n"
  ],
